      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 32 · AI Employee Onboarding\nCreates a role-specific onboarding plan and welcome email for new hires and notifies IT/manager of setup tasks.\n\n**Trigger:** `POST /webhook/employee-onboarding` (JSON body)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Gmail OAuth2, Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate.\n\n**Sample payload:**\n```json\n{\n \"name\": \"Karan\",\n \"email\": \"karan@yourco.com\",\n \"manager_email\": \"lead@yourco.com\",\n \"role\": \"Product Designer\",\n \"team\": \"Design\",\n \"start_date\": \"2026-11-17\"\n}\n```"
      }
